<item>
  <title>Trustees approve amended turnaround plan, closure of Paredes (En español)</title>
  <link>https://www.austinisd.org/announcements/2026/07/30/trustees-approve-amended-turnaround-plan-closure-paredes-en-espanol</link>
  <description>Dear Austin ISD community,&amp;nbsp;

Every child in Austin ISD deserves an exceptional education—regardless of their zip code, background, or economic status. Over the past few years, we have made decisions across our district to ensure students are learning in vibrant, fully-resourced academic environments that drive student outcomes.

However, keeping our promise to students sometimes requires making incredibly difficult decisions.</description>
  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:30:00 -0500</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>jmaldonado</dc:creator>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">9cd8bc95-d389-43fc-aaf4-52352345b1a1</guid>
    </item>

